flowchart LR
  Patient[Patient / carer] -->|booking request, cancel, check-in request| Booking[Appointment & Queue Context]
  Kiosk[Clinic kiosk] -->|untrusted check-in command| Booking
  Staff[Receptionist / authorised staff] -->|assisted check-in, exception decision| Booking
  Clinician[Doctor / nurse] -->|call next, consultation start / complete| Booking
  Manager[Clinic manager] -->|capacity, window, grace and queue policies| Config[Clinic Configuration]
  Config --> Booking
  Booking -->|minimal display / queue state| StaffBoard[Staff Dashboard]
  Booking -->|ticket number / status| PatientDisplay[Patient-facing display]
  Booking -->|minimised audit events| Audit[Restricted Audit Store]
  ClinicalRecord[Clinical record / diagnosis / treatment] -. excluded from this prototype .-> Booking
